      "Native/app source classification, source recall, long-dossier completeness, all contractual exceptions and conflict handling remain unproven.",
      "No independent legal gold, held-out/repeated-seed/causal accuracy estimate or LayaGo/GLiNER/MLX/training/speed gain.",
      "Owned extraction registration may refresh alias/index metadata; no immutable owned-graph claim."
